# Tech_Tree_Design — Skeleton

## 1. Applies when
Progression built on research/unlock graphs (strategy_simulation).

## 2. This document owns
- Tree topology: nodes, prerequisites, tiers, branch philosophies.
- Research economy: costs, research time formulas, concurrency rules.
- Unlock effects registry (what each node grants, linked to owners).

## 3. This document does NOT own
- The things being unlocked (units/buildings) — Unit / Base docs.
- Overall progression pacing — Progression_Design.
- Narrative framing of tech — Bible.

## 4. Recommended chapter structure
1. Tree philosophy / 2. Topology / 3. Tiers & branches / 4. Costs & time / 5. Concurrency / 6. Effects registry / 7. Rush vs wide balance / 8. Open questions

## 5. Common boundaries
- Tech_Tree vs Progression: this is one progression system, owned here; global pacing lives there.
- Effects are links (`see Unit_Design §X`), never restated stats.

## 6. Common audit rules
- No cyclic prerequisites; every node reachable from a start node.
- Every effect link resolves to an existing section.
